, {"claim": "Enforcing genuine accountability requires named regulatory authority and mandatory pre-deployment auditing backed by the Federal Trade Commission or a dedicated AI safety board, funded by licensing fees levied on model developers.", "targets": [], "relationship": "policy_enforcement"}]}

